OL,3,GNEWSABusy A-road to close before
OL,4,Adrivers can use new layout
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn A-road is set to close this weekend
OL,7,Fand then overnight next week to allow
OL,8,Fworks to be completed that will enable
OL,9,Fdrivers to use a new layout after years
OL,10,Fof disruption.
OL,12,FThe A417 Missing Link scheme aims
OL,13,Fimprove the connection between road
OL,14,Fsections at Brockworth and Cowley,
OL,15,FGloucestershire, and has been under way
OL,16,Fsince 2023.
OL,18,FIt is hoped from Friday 18 September,
OL,19,Fpeople can drive on the A417 between
OL,20,FGloucester and Cirencester without
OL,21,Fhaving to negotiate the Air Balloon
OL,22,FRoundabout, which is being removed.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
