OL,3,GNEWSABusy A-road to close before
OL,4,Adrivers can use new layout
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe A417 will be closed between the A46
OL,7,FBrockworth Junction and the roundabout
OL,8,Ffrom 23:00 on Friday until 06:00 on
OL,9,FMonday, and then between 21:00 and
OL,10,F06:00 from Monday to Friday 18
OL,11,FSeptember.
